{"quest_id": 6440, "name": "泣き虫な風水士", "description": "森の中、魔物に大切なものを奪われ\n嘆く少女に出会った王子たち。\n悲しみに涙する少女を救出せよ！\n初級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv1 出撃5体）", "event": "龍穴の風水士", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920108, "map_no": 5327, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 25, "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 4, "form_count": 1, "hp": 520, "attack": 10, "base_hp": 520, "base_attack": 10, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 7, "attack_speed": 50, "attack_wait": 10, "move_speed": 2000.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2000000476837158, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2099152, "race_id": 11, "master_id": 165, "global_id": 164, "spawn_sec": 3}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 17, "form_count": 1, "hp": 640, "attack": 140, "base_hp": 640, "base_attack": 140, "damage_type": "physical", "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 101, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.25, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097200, "race_id": 9, "master_id": 3, "spawn_sec": 11}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 4, "form_count": 1, "hp": 1000, "attack": 150, "base_hp": 1000, "base_attack": 150, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 20, "attack_speed": 16, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 53, "move_speed": 1300.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.25, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097184, "race_id": 11, "master_id": 2, "spawn_sec": 33}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 4, "form_count": 1, "hp": 5000, "attack": 400, "base_hp": 5000, "base_attack": 400, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 156, "move_speed": 370.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2097792, "master_id": 9, "spawn_sec": 44}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 5, "form_count": 1, "hp": 900, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 900, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "attack_speed": 60, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 153, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097360, "race_id": 9, "master_id": 16, "spawn_sec": 48}, {"enemy_id": 6, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_count": 1, "hp": 640, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 640, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "physical", "attack_range": 140, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 60, "attack_interval": 171, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2098016, "race_id": 9, "missile_id": 9, "missile": {"speed": 3.0, "deflectable": true}, "master_id": 68, "global_id": 67, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 65}], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "ゴブリン", "text": "ギャギャッ！　\nカッコイイ物差シ、拾ッタ！\nコレデ、ニンゲン、タオス！", "face": "lfc3843a419e4"}, {"name": "？？？", "text": "お……お願いします、魔物さん。返してください。\nその『風水尺』はとっても大切なものなんです。", "face": "u618"}, {"name": "ゴブリン", "text": "イヤダ、返サナイ！\nコレデモ、喰ラエ！", "face": "lfc3843a419e4"}, {"name": "？？？", "text": "あいたッ！　痛い、痛いですぅ！\nう……ふぇえ～ん！　ぶたないでくださいぃ～ッ！", "face": "u618"}, {"name": "バシラ", "text": "あれは――！\n王子、向こうで女の子が\n魔物に物差しのようなもので叩かれています！", "face": "u28"}, {"name": "ケイティ", "text": "物差しで？\nいったい何事ですか、その状況は？", "face": "u114"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "とにかく助けに行きましょう！\n王子、ご指示をお願いします。", "face": "l418999b7c970"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "？？？", "text": "ひぃいッ！　も、もうぶたないでくださいぃ！", "face": "u618"}, {"name": "バシラ", "text": "ふふ、大丈夫ですよ。\n魔物は退治しましたし、私たちは味方ですから。\nね、王子？", "face": "u28"}, {"name": "王子", "text": "…………。", "face": "u1"}, {"name": "？？？", "text": "ふぇっ？　\nあ……あなたが噂の王子様ですか？", "face": "u618"}, {"name": "ダニエラ", "text": "ふぅん、訳ありみたいね。\nお嬢ちゃん、王子にどんな用かしら？", "face": "u43"}, {"name": "？？？", "text": "そ、それはその……えっと、ええと……。", "face": "u618"}, {"name": "モーティマ", "text": "んな怖がらねえでも大丈夫だっつうの。\n取って食ったりはしねえんだからよ。", "face": "u14"}, {"name": "？？？", "text": "ひぃぃッ！　く……クマさんですかっ！？", "face": "u618"}, {"name": "モーティマ", "text": "ったく、誰がクマだっつうの。\nおい嬢ちゃん、怒らねえからなんでも話してみな？", "face": "u14"}, {"name": "？？？", "text": "しくしく……うぅ……邪仙たちが、\n華の国の、わたしの故郷を襲って……、\nひっく……それから、東の国に……っ。", "face": "u618"}, {"name": "ケイティ", "text": "――ッ！\nでは、ついに邪仙たちによる\n東の国への本格的な侵攻が始まったと？", "face": "u114"}, {"name": "？？？", "text": "あわわわわ……。\nそ、そんなにじっと見つめられては……。", "face": "u618"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "……王子、彼女は動転しているようです。\nひとまず落ち着ける場所にお連れして、\nそこで詳しいお話を伺いましょう。"}]}], "active": true}